    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend chapter 352 of the laws of 2005, amending the education law relation to implementation of the federal individuals with disabilities education improvement act of 2004, in relation to extending the expiration; to amend chapter 430 of the laws of 2006, amending the education law relating to implementation of the federal individuals with disabilities education improvement act of 2004, in relation to extending the expiration; and to amend chapter 378 of the laws of 2007 amending the education law relating to the implementation of the federal individuals with disabilities education improvement act of 2004, in relation to extending the effectiveness thereof",
    "basePrintNo": "S5884",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S5884-2009",
    "coSponsors": {
